            "review_title": "Review at Lilliput Diamond",
            "review_text": "Huy Thắng H\n4 contributions\n0\nDelicious food, beautiful view, clean space\nMay 2024 • Family\nThe play area is clean and beautiful, the toys are suitable for my child, my child really likes it. The price compared to the general level is a bit high but worth it for what you get. Delicious food, beautiful view, very dedicated staff. This will definitely be a regular place for my family\nShow original\nWritten May 7, 2024",
